                                "sense_id": "0d8c3b1d-6a06-3875-baf6-72bd9d2f11d3",
                                "text": "Heart contractions are usually recorded with a Cushny myocardiograph sewn to the wall of the left ventricle and attached to a simple quasi-isometric lever system."
